OL,3,GNEWSADriver who fatally crushed
OL,4,Amum-of-two jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA driver who killed a mother-of-two
OL,7,Fwhen he reversed into her has been
OL,8,Fjailed for more than seven years.
OL,10,FKiel Sanderson fatally struck
OL,11,F48-year-old Donna Smith in the
OL,12,FQueensbury area of Bradford on 29
OL,13,FAugust 2025, before setting fire to his
OL,14,Fcar in a bid to hide potentially vital
OL,15,Fevidence.
OL,17,FSanderson, 40, had earlier been found
OL,18,Fguilty of causing death by dangerous
OL,19,Fdriving following a trial at Bradford
OL,20,FCrown Court, having already admitted a
OL,21,Fcharge of perverting the course of
OL,22,Fjustice.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
