OL,3,GNEWSADriver who fatally crushed
OL,4,Amum-of-two jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement, the victim's family
OL,7,Fsaid she was "missed so very much",
OL,8,Fadding that "no sentence will bring
OL,9,FDonna back".
